## ObjectType: Lot Transformation

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| link_id | Link id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | link_id |
| parent_lot_id | Parent lot id | string | Foreign key to lots; blank creates no edge. | parent_lot_id |
| child_lot_id | Child lot id | string | Foreign key to lots; blank creates no edge. | child_lot_id |
| link_type | Link type | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: Lot split, Product transformation. | link_type |
| link_type_code | Link type code | string | Stable machine code; localized display value is separate. Allowed values: split, transform. | link_type_code |
| parent_quantity | Parent quantity | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | parent_quantity |
| child_quantity | Child quantity | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | child_quantity |
| unit | Unit | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: ea. | unit |
| effective_date | Effective date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | effective_date |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | known_date |

### Keys

Primary Keys: link_id
Display Key: link_id
